# Runtime dependencies for the MCP OAuth Gateway (source of truth).
#
# The gateway is a separately-deployed, security-sensitive component, so it
# deliberately exact-pins its runtime dependencies for reproducible builds. This
# is an intentional exception to the backend's ">=" minimum-pin policy (see
# STRUCTURE_REVIEW.md C3); do not relax these to ranges.
#
# requirements.txt is GENERATED from this file with fully-pinned, hash-verified
# dependencies. After editing this file, regenerate the lock:
#
#   uv pip compile --universal --generate-hashes \
#     services/mcp_oauth_gateway/requirements.in \
#     -o services/mcp_oauth_gateway/requirements.txt
